assistant: Subject: Convert vendor 2026-10-01 cent prices to dollars

Starting with `vendor-api-version: 2026-10-01`, the vendor sends `price` in cents (119900 instead of 1199). The spec still only says "Unit price," and the field name and type stayed the same. `search_products` passed the value through unchanged, so it reported prices 100× too high. I added a `priceToDollars` helper in `src/vendor.ts` that checks the response's `vendor-api-version` header and divides by 100 for 2026-10-01 or later. `search_products` now uses it, and older responses pass through unchanged, so the v1 fixtures give exactly the same output. Typecheck, lint and all 14 tests pass, including the repro test. `get_product` and `get_order` also pass prices straight through and probably have the same bug on the new version, but I didn't change them because they're outside this fix.

